]:translate-y-[2px] text-center whitespace-nowrap px-1.5 py-1.5 text-[12px] text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300" style="width:2.0833333333333335%;min-width:100px"><div class="text-center text-xs text-muted-foreground">Qwen</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-3"><span class="text-[12px] text-black/35 dark:text-white/30 tabular-nums">Showing<!-- --> <!-- -->1<!-- -->–<!-- -->30<!-- --> <!-- -->of <!-- -->179<!-- --> models</span><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><button disabled="" class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[12px] rounded-md border border-black/[0.08] dark:border-white/[0.08] text-black/60 dark:text-white/50 hover:bg-black/[0.03] dark:hover:bg-white/[0.04] disabled:opacity-30 disabled:cursor-not-allowed transition-colors">Previous</button><button class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[12px] rounded-md border border-black/[0.08] dark:border-white/[0.08] text-black/60 dark:text-white/50 hover:bg-black/[0.03] dark:hover:bg-white/[0.04] disabled:opacity-30 disabled:cursor-not-allowed transition-colors">Next</button></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-8"></div></div></div><section aria-labelledby="lb-seo-heading" class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-10 py-16 border-t border-black/[0.04] dark:border-white/[0.04]"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Dataset","name":"Open LLM Leaderboard - LLM Stats","description":"Independent ranking of open-weight large language models — Llama, Qwen, GLM, DeepSeek, Mistral, Kimi and more — by coding-arena score, GPQA Diamond, throughput, latency, and per-token pricing.","url":"https://llm-stats.com/leaderboards/open-llm-leaderboard","creator":{"@type":"Organization","name":"LLM Stats","url":"https://llm-stats.com"},"publisher":{"@id":"https://llm-stats.com/#organization"},"measurementTechnique":"Aggregated benchmark scores from public model evaluations and provider-reported results.","spatialCoverage":"Worldwide","isAccessibleForFree":true,"license":"https://llm-stats.com/legal/terms-of-service","citation":"LLM Stats (2026). LLM benchmark and pricing dataset. https://llm-stats.com","keywords":["llm leaderboard","ai benchmark","model comparison","ai pricing","open llm leaderboard"],"variableMeasured":["GPQA Diamond","Coding Arena Score","Output throughput (tokens/sec)","Time to first token (s)","Input price (USD per 1M tokens)","Output price (USD per 1M tokens)","Context window (tokens)"],"dateModified":"2026-05-13T02:50:41.781Z","distribution":[{"@type":"DataDownload","name":"Models list (JSON)","contentUrl":"https://api.zeroeval.com/leaderboard/models/list","encodingFormat":"application/json"},{"@type":"DataDownload","name":"Per-model metrics (JSON)","contentUrl":"https://api.zeroeval.com/v1/models/metrics","encodingFormat":"application/json"}]}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the best LLM right now?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Based on coding-arena performance — the most discriminating signal at the frontier — Gemini 3.1 Pro currently leads. For knowledge-heavy reasoning (GPQA Diamond), Claude Mythos Preview scores highest. Choose by axis rather than a single ranking — see the highlights above for per-metric leaders."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does the Open LLM Leaderboard rank models?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Models are sorted by coding-arena score (when available), then by GPQA Diamond. Each row aggregates verified benchmark results, provider-reported pricing, and live performance metrics (output throughput and time-to-first-token) sampled across the major API providers. See the LLM Stats Score methodology for the full weighting and refresh cadence."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How many models are tracked?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"This leaderboard tracks 298 canonical models across every major lab and provider. New releases typically appear within hours."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Where does pricing data come from?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Per-model input/output pricing is pulled from each provider's public API price list and verified against billing samples from the LLM Stats proxy. When a model is hosted by multiple providers, the cheapest available rate is shown by default."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How is performance measured?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Output throughput (tokens/second) and time-to-first-token are measured by routing standardized prompts through each provider's API and averaging over a 7-day rolling window. Numbers update hourly. Per-model splits live on each model detail page."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How often does the data update?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Pricing and model metadata revalidate every hour. Live performance metrics update on a 7-day rolling average. Benchmark scores update when a new verified result is published or a new evaluation lands on LLM Stats."}}]}</script><h2 id="lb-seo-heading" class="text-2xl font-normal mb-2 text-foreground dark:text-foreground">Open LLM Leaderboard<!-- --> highlights</h2><p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 max-w-3xl">Independent ranking of open-weight large language models — Llama, Qwen, GLM, DeepSeek, Mistral, Kimi and more — by coding-arena score, GPQA Diamond, throughput, latency, and per-token pricing.<!-- --> Updated continuously from provider APIs and verified benchmarks. See the<!-- --> <a class="underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-foreground" href="/methodology/llm-stats-score">LLM Stats Score methodology</a> <!-- -->for how rankings are computed.</p><ul class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-8 gap-y-3 text-[14px] text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300"><li><span class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Best for coding (Arena)<!-- -->:</span> <a class="font-medium text-foreground hover:underline underline-offset-2" href="/models/gemini-3.1-pro-preview">Gemini 3.1 Pro</a> <span class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">(<!-- -->20.9 arena score<!-- -->)</span></li><li><span class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Best on GPQA Diamond<!-- -->:</span> <a class="font-medium text-foreground hover:underline underline-offset-2" href="/models/claude-mythos-preview">Claude Mythos Preview</a> <span class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">(<!-- -->94.6%<!-- -->)</span></li><li><span class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Best on AIME 2025<!-- -->:</span> <a class="font-medium text-foreground hover:underline underline-offset-2" href="/models/gemini-3-pro-preview">Gemini 3 Pro</a> <span class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">(<!-- -->100.0%<!-- -->)</span></li><li><span class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Best on SWE-Bench Verified<!-- -->:</span> <a class="font-medium text-foreground hover:underline underline-offset-2" href="/models/claude-mythos-preview">Claude Mythos Preview</a> <span class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">(<!-- -->93.9%<!-- -->)</span></li><li><span class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Highest throughput<!-- -->:</span> <a class="font-medium text-foreground hover:underline underline-offset-2" href="/models/mercury-2">Mercury 2</a> <span class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">(<!-- -->1195 tok/s<!-- -->)</span></li><li><span class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Lowest latency<!-- -->:</span> <a class="font-medium text-foreground hover:underline underline-offset-2" href="/models/qwen3-30b-a3b">Qwen3 30B A3B</a> <span class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">(<!-- -->328.00 s<!-- -->)</span></li><li><span class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Cheapest input<!-- -->:</span> <a class="font-medium text-foreground hover:underline underline-offset-2" href="/models/nemotron-3-nano-30b-a3b">Nemotron 3 Nano (30B A3B)</a> <span class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">(<!-- -->$0.06 / 1M tok<!-- -->)</span></li><li><span class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Largest context window<!-- -->:</span> <a class="font-medium text-foreground hover:underline underline-offset-2" href="/models/grok-4.20-beta-0309-non-reasoning">Grok-4.20 Beta Non-Reasoning</a> <span class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">(<!-- -->2.0M tokens<!-- -->)</span></li></ul><div class="mt-12"><section id="faq" class="space-y-6" aria-labelledby="faq-heading"><header class="max-w-3xl"><h2 id="faq-heading" class="text-[22px] sm:text-[26px] font-medium leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.02em] text-black/92 dark:text-white/92">FAQ</h2><p class="mt-2 text-[13px] leading-[1.65] text-black/55 dark:text-white/55">Common questions about the open llm leaderboard</p></header><div class="space-y-px border-y border-black/[0.06] dark:border-white/[0.08]"><details id="faq-best-overall" open="" class="group block border-b border-black/[0.06] dark:border-white/[0.08] last:border-b-0 [&amp;_.faq-icon]:open:rotate-45"><summary class="list-none cursor-pointer w-full px-0 py-4 flex items-start justify-between text-left hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity duration-150 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><h3 class="text-[15px] font-medium text-black/90 dark:text-white/90 pr-6 leading-snug tracking-[-0.005em]">What is the best LLM right now?</h3><span class="faq-icon mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center text-black/40 transition-transform duration-200 ease-out group-open:rotate-45 dark:text-white/40"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></summary><div class="pb-5 pr-10"><div class="text-[14px] text-black/60 dark:text-white/55 leading-[1.7]">Based on coding-arena performance — the most discriminating signal at the frontier — Gemini 3.1 Pro currently leads. For knowledge-heavy reasoning (GPQA Diamond), Claude Mythos Preview scores highest. Choose by axis rather than a single ranking — see the highlights above for per-metric leaders.</div></div></details><details id="faq-method" class="group block border-b border-black/[0.06] dark:border-white/[0.08] last:border-b-0 [&amp;_.faq-icon]:open:rotate-45"><summary class="list-none cursor-pointer w-full px-0 py-4 flex items-start justify-between text-left hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity duration-150 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><h3 class="text-[15px] font-medium text-black/90 dark:text-white/90 pr-6 leading-snug tracking-[-0.005em]">How does the Open LLM Leaderboard rank models?</h3><span class="faq-icon mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center text-black/40 transition-transform duration-200 ease-out group-open:rotate-45 dark:text-white/40"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></summary><div class="pb-5 pr-10"><div class="text-[14px] text-black/60 dark:text-white/55 leading-[1.7]">Models are sorted by coding-arena score (when available), then by GPQA Diamond. Each row aggregates verified benchmark results, provider-reported pricing, and live performance metrics (output throughput and time-to-first-token) sampled across the major API providers. See the <a href="/methodology/llm-stats-score">LLM Stats Score methodology</a> for the full weighting and refresh cadence.</div></div></details><details id="faq-coverage" class="group block border-b border-black/[0.06] dark:border-white/[0.08] last:border-b-0 [&amp;_.faq-icon]:open:rotate-45"><summary class="list-none cursor-pointer w-full px-0 py-4 flex items-start justify-between text-left hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity duration-150 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><h3 class="text-[15px] font-medium text-black/90 dark:text-white/90 pr-6 leading-snug tracking-[-0.005em]">How many models are tracked?</h3><span class="faq-icon mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center text-black/40 transition-transform duration-200 ease-out group-open:rotate-45 dark:text-white/40"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></summary><div class="pb-5 pr-10"><div class="text-[14px] text-black/60 dark:text-white/55 leading-[1.7]">This leaderboard tracks 298 canonical models across every major lab and provider. New releases typically appear within hours.</div></div></details><details id="faq-pricing-source" class="group block border-b border-black/[0.06] dark:border-white/[0.08] last:border-b-0 [&amp;_.faq-icon]:open:rotate-45"><summary class="list-none cursor-pointer w-full px-0 py-4 flex items-start justify-between text-left hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity duration-150 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><h3 class="text-[15px] font-medium text-black/90 dark:text-white/90 pr-6 leading-snug tracking-[-0.005em]">Where does pricing data come from?</h3><span class="faq-icon mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center text-black/40 transition-transform duration-200 ease-out group-open:rotate-45 dark:text-white/40"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></summary><div class="pb-5 pr-10"><div class="text-[14px] text-black/60 dark:text-white/55 leading-[1.7]">Per-model input/output pricing is pulled from each provider's public API price list and verified against billing samples from the LLM Stats proxy. When a model is hosted by multiple providers, the cheapest available rate is shown by default.</div></div></details><details id="faq-perf-source" class="group block border-b border-black/[0.06] dark:border-white/[0.08] last:border-b-0 [&amp;_.faq-icon]:open:rotate-45"><summary class="list-none cursor-pointer w-full px-0 py-4 flex items-start justify-between text-left hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity duration-150 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><h3 class="text-[15px] font-medium text-black/90 dark:text-white/90 pr-6 leading-snug tracking-[-0.005em]">How is performance measured?</h3><span class="faq-icon mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center text-black/40 transition-transform duration-200 ease-out group-open:rotate-45 dark:text-white/40"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></summary><div class="pb-5 pr-10"><div class="text-[14px] text-black/60 dark:text-white/55 leading-[1.7]">Output throughput (tokens/second) and time-to-first-token are measured by routing standardized prompts through each provider's API and averaging over a 7-day rolling window. Numbers update hourly. Per-model splits live on each model detail page.</div></div></details><details id="faq-refresh" class="group block border-b border-black/[0.06] dark:border-white/[0.08] last:border-b-0 [&amp;_.faq-icon]:open:rotate-45"><summary class="list-none cursor-pointer w-full px-0 py-4 flex items-start justify-between text-left hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity duration-150 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><h3 class="text-[15px] font-medium text-black/90 dark:text-white/90 pr-6 leading-snug tracking-[-0.005em]">How often does the data update?</h3><span class="faq-icon mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center text-black/40 transition-transform duration-200 ease-out group-open:rotate-45 dark:text-white/40"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></summary><div class="pb-5 pr-10"><div class="text-[14px] text-black/60 dark:text-white/55 leading-[1.7]">Pricing and model metadata revalidate every hour. Live performance metrics update on a 7-day rolling average. Benchmark scores update when a new verified result is published or a new evaluation lands on LLM Stats.</div></div></details></div></section></div></section></main><footer class="relative w-full bg-background mt-auto"><section class="relative py-12 bg-gradient-to-b from-black/[0.015] to-black/[0.035] dark:from-white/[0.015] dark:to-white/[0.035]"><div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-border/60 to-transparent"></div><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-8"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr,1.1fr] gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center"><div class="space-y-3"><h3 class="text-[19px] font-normal text-foreground tracking-[-0.02em] leading-snug">Join our newsletter and stay up to date with everything AI</h3><p class="text-[13px] text-muted-foreground/60 max-w-md leading-[1.6]">There&#x27;s too much noise in AI, let&#x27;s filter it for you. Get a curated digest of models, benchmarks, and the analysis that matters, right in your inbox once a week.</p></div><div class="lg:justify-self-end w-full lg:max-w-md"><form><div class="hidden"></div><div class="flex gap-2 p-1.5 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-white/[0.03] border border-black/[0.06] dark:border-white/[0.08] shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04),0_4px_12px_rgb